sequenceDiagram
    actor U as User
    participant F as Frontend
    participant B as Backend (FastAPI)
    participant DB as PostgreSQL

    U->>F: Enters the search criteria
    F->>B: GET /neos (criteria + sorting)
    B->>DB: Search for matching NEOs
    DB-->>B: List of NEOs

    alt Results exist
        B-->>F: List of NEOs
        F-->>U: Show the sorted results
    else No results
        B-->>F: Empty list
        F-->>U: Show "no NEO found"
    end